    "description": "Exact version match for a 2.5.0 library. 2.5.0 generalizes `ic` equations (esm-spec \u00a711.4.3) and deprecates `initialization_equations` (\u00a711.4.4); this document uses neither, so it is the 2.4.0 baseline restamped.",
